Source: https://github.com/pillarsdotnet/timesheet
Comment: The vendor/ directory comes from the orig-vendor component tarball,
 which debian/make-orig-tarballs.sh builds from Cargo.lock. Crates that only
 build for Windows, macOS or WebAssembly are stubbed there to their
 Cargo.toml. That script also regenerates the vendor/ paragraphs below.

